xt": "Section III \u2014 Module C: The Craft of Writing", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08158508158508158, "x1": 0.589010989010989, "y1": 0.09712509712509712}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.11655011655011654, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.12665112665112666}, {"text": "Attempt Question 3", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.13286713286713286, "x1": 0.2879120879120879, "y1": 0.14607614607614608}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.14996114996114995, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.16006216006216006}, {"text": "Answer the question on pages 18-24 of the Paper 2 Writing Booklet. Extra writing booklets", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.18337218337218336, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.19658119658119658}, {"text": "are available.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.19968919968919968, "x1": 0.22637362637362637, "y1": 0.2097902097902098}, {"text": "Your answer will be a:", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.22999222999222999, "x1": 0.321978021978022, "y1": 0.2400932400932401}, {"text": "ssed on how well you:", "x0": 0.34835164835164834, "y0": 0.22999222999222999, "x1": 0.5274725274725275, "y1": 0.2432012432012432}, {"text": "\u00a9 craft language to address the demands of the question", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2501942501942502, "x1": 0.6010989010989011, "y1": 0.2634032634032634}, {"text": "\u00a9 use language appropriate to audience, purpose and form to shape meaning", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2703962703962704, "x1": 0.7681318681318682, "y1": 0.2836052836052836}, {"text": "Question 3 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.31546231546231546, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.3278943278943279}, {"text": "\u201cA fond memory brings you a wave of comfort and ignites the senses. It\u2019s the kind of memory", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.34887334887334887, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.3620823620823621}, {"text": "you can visualise and describe in rich detail.\u2019 \u201cThis article was originally published as", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3581973581973582, "x1": 0.878021978021978, "y1": 0.3838383838383838}, {"text": "\u2018How to lve ike an Epicurean\u2019 on Psyche", "x0": 0.6307692307692307, "y0": 0.3822843822843823, "x1": 0.8747252747252747, "y1": 0.3916083916083916}, {"text": "Using the stimulus above, craft an imaginative or discursive piece of writing that captures the", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4149184149184149, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.4281274281274281}, {"text": "richness of a fond memory.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.432012432012432, "x1": 0.34065934065934067, "y1": 0.44522144522144524}, {"text": "End of paper", "x0": 0.44285714285714284, "y0": 0.4988344988344988, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.5120435120435121}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43626373626373627, "y0": 0.3550893550893551, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.3644133644133644}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.43626373626373627, "y0": 0.3550893550893551, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.3644133644133644}, {"text": "(\u00a9 2025 NSW Edueation Standards Authority", "x0": 0.3824175824175824, "y0": 0.9673659673659674, "x1": 0.6164835164835165, "y1": 0.9751359751359752}]]